# Pins line endings on checkout for the text formats this repo defines
# byte-identical round-trip fidelity over, regardless of a contributor's
# platform or local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows checkout
# converts these files to CRLF (T-0125): the fixture stops parsing as
# frontmatter, test corruption helpers stop matching, and round-trip
# comparisons against the on-disk fixture stop being byte-for-byte.
*.md eol=lf
*.yaml eol=lf
*.yml eol=lf
*.json eol=lf
*.ts eol=lf
*.tsx eol=lf
*.mjs eol=lf
*.css eol=lf
*.html eol=lf
*.rs eol=lf
*.sh eol=lf
*.toml eol=lf

# Sidecar binaries and image/icon assets are never diffed or line-ended.
apps/desktop/src-tauri/binaries/** binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
